; User-facing dependency download and installation errors.
; Included by the architecture-specific dependency scripts. Keep all language
; prefixes and message keys in sync.

chinesesimplified.DependencyDownloadCancelled=下载已取消。
chinesesimplified.DependencyDownloadFailedSummary=magnetic-desk 依赖项下载失败。
chinesesimplified.DependencyInstallFailedSummary=magnetic-desk 依赖项安装失败。
chinesesimplified.DependencyDownloadFailed=%1 下载失败。%n主 URL：%2%n备用 URL：%3%n错误：%4
chinesesimplified.DependencyInstallStartFailed=%1 安装程序无法以管理员权限启动。请允许 Windows 提示，然后重试。
chinesesimplified.DependencyInstallFailed=%1 安装失败。退出代码：%2。%n请确认此 Windows 版本受支持，或手动安装依赖项后重新运行 magnetic-desk 安装程序。
chinesesimplified.RuntimeDependencyComment=此安装程序会根据需要检测并下载 .NET 10 Runtime 和 Windows App Runtime 2.5。

english.DependencyDownloadCancelled=Download was cancelled.
english.DependencyDownloadFailedSummary=magnetic-desk dependencies could not be downloaded.
english.DependencyInstallFailedSummary=magnetic-desk dependencies could not be installed.
english.DependencyDownloadFailed=%1 download failed.%nPrimary URL: %2%nFallback URL: %3%nError: %4
english.DependencyInstallStartFailed=%1 installer could not be started with administrator permission. Please allow the Windows prompt and try again.
english.DependencyInstallFailed=%1 installation failed. Exit code: %2.%nPlease confirm this Windows version is supported, or install the dependency manually and run magnetic-desk setup again.
english.RuntimeDependencyComment=This installer detects and downloads .NET 10 Runtime and Windows App Runtime 2.5 as needed.











